<title>ITALY: Credito Italiano cons net profit up in '96.</title>
<headline>Credito Italiano cons net profit up in '96.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	     282  (up 43.5 pct)</p>
<p>    Gross operating profit  2,260  (up 10.6 pct)</p>
<p>    Direct deposits	 103,000  (up 10 pct)</p>
<p>    Indirect deposits     200,000  (up 13 pct)</p>
<p>    Client credits	   82,000  (9.6 pct)</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
